&lt;h2 id=&#34;installation&#34;&gt;Installation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Check out the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.swmansion.com/react-native-reanimated/docs/fundamentals/getting-started/#installation&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;installation&lt;/a&gt; section of our docs for the detailed installation instructions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;compatibility&#34;&gt;Compatibility
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;React Native Reanimated 4.x supports only the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://reactnative.dev/architecture/landing-page&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;New React Native architecture&lt;/a&gt; and three latest React Native versions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If your app still runs on the old architecture, please consider adopting the New Architecture or stay with latest 3.x release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;documentation&#34;&gt;Documentation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Check out our dedicated documentation page for info about this library, API reference and more: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.swmansion.com/react-native-reanimated/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://docs.swmansion.com/react-native-reanimated/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;examples&#34;&gt;Examples
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The source code for the example (showcase) app is under the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/software-mansion/react-native-reanimated/blob/main/apps/common-app/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;code&gt;apps/common-app&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; directory.
If you want to play with the API but don&amp;rsquo;t feel like trying it on a real app, you can run the example project. Check &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;apps/fabric-example/README.md&#34; &gt;Example README&lt;/a&gt; for installation instructions.&lt;/p&gt;
